WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
MobaRust. A real desktop walkthrough, light mode first.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Run commands in a native local terminal.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
This curl request reaches an isolated loopback demo API.

00:16.000 --> 00:26.000
Split the terminal to keep two independent shells side by side.

00:26.000 --> 00:37.000
Quick Connect parses an example SSH URI into connection fields.
No SSH connection is made in this demonstration.

00:37.000 --> 00:49.000
Prepare a reusable command snippet and review it before execution.

00:49.000 --> 00:58.000
Switch to dark mode in one click. The terminal changes with the workspace.

00:58.000 --> 01:02.000
Download the desktop preview for Mac, Windows, and Linux.
